{"action-states":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Action States</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">ShouldTrackAction makes the button report the action it starts: the owning form when IsSubmit is set, or the promise OnClickFunc returns. It shows PendingLabel while the action runs, then SucceededLabel or FailedLabel for two seconds. PendingIcon, SucceededIcon, and FailedIcon replace the default icons, and PendingIconAnimation takes a uiToolset.Animation* constant. IsPendingOneWayStatePath shows the pending state from Alpine state.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/control/button.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>&lt;form hx-post=&#34;/api/v1/account/&#34; hx-swap=&#34;none&#34;&gt;\n\t@uiControl.Button(uiControl.ButtonSettings{\n\t\tLabel:    &#34;Save&#34;,\n\t\tIsSubmit: true,\n\n\t\t// OptionalFields\n\t\tShouldTrackAction:    true,\n\t\tPendingLabel:         &#34;Saving&#34;,\n\t\tPendingIcon:          &#34;ph-hourglass&#34;,\n\t\tPendingIconAnimation: uiToolset.AnimationPulse,\n\t\tSucceededLabel:       &#34;Saved&#34;,\n\t\tSucceededIcon:        &#34;ph-thumbs-up&#34;,\n\t\tFailedLabel:          &#34;Save failed&#34;,\n\t\tFailedIcon:           &#34;ph-skull&#34;,\n\t})\n&lt;/form&gt;\n\n@uiControl.Button(uiControl.ButtonSettings{\n\tLabel:       &#34;Sync&#34;,\n\tOnClickFunc: &#34;UiToolset.JsonAjax(&#39;POST&#39;, &#39;/api/v1/sync/&#39;)&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tShouldTrackAction: true,\n\tPendingLabel:      &#34;Syncing&#34;,\n\tSucceededLabel:    &#34;Synced&#34;,\n\tFailedLabel:       &#34;Sync failed&#34;,\n})\n\n@uiControl.Button(uiControl.ButtonSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Delete account&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tIsPendingOneWayStatePath: &#34;isSyncing&#34;,\n\tPendingLabel:             &#34;Wait for the sync&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\">UiToolset.RegisterAlpineState(()=>{function e(n){return new Promise((t,r)=>{setTimeout(()=>{if(n){t();return}r(new Error(\"DemoMirrorUnreachable\"))},1500)})}Alpine.data(\"buttonDemoActions\",()=>({isSyncing:!1,syncAccounts(){return e(!0)},syncBrokenMirror(){return e(!1)},startSharedSync(){this.isSyncing=!0,setTimeout(()=>{this.isSyncing=!1},1500)}}))});\n</script><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"buttonDemoActions\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-neutral-400\">Form actions</p><div class=\"flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-3\"><form hx-get=\"assets/ui-logo.svg\" hx-swap=\"none\"><!-- Button --><script type=\"text/javascript\" charset=\"UTF-8\">UiToolset.RegisterAlpineState(()=>{function o(s){setTimeout(s,0)}Alpine.data(\"buttonAction\",(s,n,r)=>({actionStatus:\"idle\",actionResultTimeoutId:null,actionListenersController:new AbortController,submittedForm:null,init(){if(!r)return;const t=this.$el.closest(\"form\");if(!t){console.error(\"ButtonActionFormNotFound\");return}this.submittedForm=t;const e={signal:this.actionListenersController.signal};t.addEventListener(\"submit\",i=>this.blockRepeatedSubmission(i),{...e,capture:!0}),t.addEventListener(\"submit\",i=>this.markNativeSubmissionPending(i),e),t.addEventListener(\"htmx:beforeSend\",i=>this.markRequestPending(i),e),t.addEventListener(\"htmx:afterRequest\",i=>this.showRequestResult(i),e),window.addEventListener(\"pageshow\",i=>this.resetRestoredPage(i),e)},destroy(){this.actionListenersController.abort(),clearTimeout(this.actionResultTimeoutId)},markActionPending(){clearTimeout(this.actionResultTimeoutId),this.actionStatus=\"pending\"},showActionResult(t){this.actionStatus=t,this.actionResultTimeoutId=setTimeout(()=>{this.actionStatus=\"idle\"},2e3)},trackActionPromise(t){typeof t?.then==\"function\"&&(this.markActionPending(),t.then(()=>this.showActionResult(\"succeeded\"),i=>{console.error(`ButtonActionFailed: ${i?.message}`),this.showActionResult(\"failed\")}))},blockRepeatedSubmission(t){this.actionStatus===\"pending\"&&(t.preventDefault(),t.stopImmediatePropagation())},markNativeSubmissionPending(t){const e=this.submittedForm.target;(e===\"\"||e===\"_self\")&&o(()=>{t.defaultPrevented||this.markActionPending()})},markRequestPending(t){t.detail.elt===this.submittedForm&&this.markActionPending()},showRequestResult(t){if(!(t.detail.elt===this.submittedForm))return;let i=\"failed\";t.detail.successful&&(i=\"succeeded\"),this.showActionResult(i)},resetRestoredPage(t){t.persisted&&(this.actionStatus=\"idle\")},actionDisplayStatusResolver(t){return t?\"pending\":this.actionStatus},isActionPending(t){return this.actionDisplayStatusResolver(t)===\"pending\"},actionLabelResolver(t){const e=this.actionDisplayStatusResolver(t);return s[e]},actionIconResolver(t){const e=this.actionDisplayStatusResolver(t);return n[e]}}))});\n</script><div class=\"contents\" x-data=\"buttonAction({&#34;idle&#34;:&#34;Save&#34;,&#34;pending&#34;:&#34;Saving&#34;,&#34;succeeded&#34;:&#34;Saved&#34;,&#34;failed&#34;:&#34;Save failed&#34;},{&#34;idle&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;pending&#34;:&#34;ph-spinner animate-spin&#34;,&#34;succeeded&#34;:&#34;ph-check-circle&#34;,&#34;failed&#34;:&#34;ph-warning-circle&#34;},true)\"><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"isActionPending(false)\" :aria-busy=\"isActionPending(false)\" class=\"w-fit bg-primary-600 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-