\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/control/button.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiControl.Button(uiControl.ButtonSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Save&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tBackgroundColor:      &#34;emerald-500&#34;,\n\tBackgroundColorHover: &#34;emerald-600&#34;,\n\tTextColor:            &#34;neutral-50&#34;,\n\tTextColorHover:       &#34;neutral-50&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-info text-base\"></i> Default </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-red-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-warning text-base\"></i> Red </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\">Green <i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-base\"></i> </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-secondary-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-star text-base\"></i> Secondary </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-fit bg-sky-500/10 hover:bg-sky-500/20  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-sky-200 hover:text-sky-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-cursor-click text-base\"></i> Hover Text </button> </div></div></div></div>","disabled-binding":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Disabled Binding</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">IsDisabledOneWayStatePath disables the button from Alpine state. IsDisabled disables it outright. IsVisibleOneWayStatePath hides it from Alpine state, and OnClickPreventDefault calls preventDefault before the click handler.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/control/button.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiControl.Button(uiControl.ButtonSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Click Me&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tOnClickFunc:               &#34;clickCount++&#34;,\n\tOnClickPreventDefault:     true,\n\tIsDisabled:                true,\n\tIsDisabledOneWayStatePath: &#34;shouldDisable&#34;,\n\tIsVisibleOneWayStatePath:  &#34;isVisible&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div x-data=\"{clickCount: 0, isVisible: true, get shouldDisable() { return this.clickCount > 0 }}\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" @click.prevent=\"clickCount++\" :disabled=\"shouldDisable\" x-show=\"isVisible\" class=\"w-full bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\" :class=\"(shouldDisable) &amp;&amp; &#39;opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed pointer-events-none&#39;\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-plus text-base\"></i> Click Me </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-full\"><button type=\"button\" disabled class=\"w-full bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-2 py-2.5 text-base gap-1 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed pointer-events-none\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-prohibit text-base\"></i> Always Disabled </button> </div><div class=\"flex flex-row items-center gap-2\"><p class=\"rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Count: <span x-text=\"clickCount\"></span></p><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"clickCount = 0\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-50/7.5 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-full  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-counter-clockwise text-base\"></i> </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"isVisible = !isVisible\" class=\"w-fit bg-neutral-700 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 